<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= typeof title !== 'undefined' ? title : 'Beranda' %> — KilatOTP Modern Service</title>
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-950 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans antialiased">

  <!-- Navbar -->
  <header class="w-full py-5 px-6 md:px-12 flex justify-between items-center max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
      <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/30">K</div>
      <span class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">Kilat<span class="text-blue-600">OTP</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
      <a href="/login" class="px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 transition-all">Masuk</a>
      <a href="/register" class="px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 rounded-xl shadow-md shadow-blue-600/20 transition-all">Daftar</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <main class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-12 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 text-xs font-semibold mb-6">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-600 animate-pulse"></span>
      <span>Sistem Otomatisasi OTP Cepat & Stabil</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6 leading-tight">
      Solusi Verifikasi Nomor Virtual <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-indigo-600">Tanpa Batas</span>
    </h1>
    
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      Platform penyedia layanan nomor OTP instan untuk berbagai kebutuhan verifikasi akun digital Anda. Cepat, aman, otomatis, dan bergaransi.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row space-y-3 sm:space-y-0 sm:space-x-4 w-full sm:w-auto justify-center">
      <a href="/register" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/25 transition-all text-center">
        Mulai Sekarang
      </a>
      <a href="/login" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 font-semibold rounded-2xl shadow-sm transition-all text-center">
        Masuk ke Akun
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Feature Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-20 w-full text-left">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-base mb-1">Proses Kilat</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Nomor langsung aktif dan SMS OTP masuk dalam hitungan detik secara real-time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4">🛡️</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-base mb-1">Aman & Terpercaya</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Sistem terlindung enkripsi tingkat tinggi dengan pembaruan otomatis setiap waktu.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4">💳</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-base mb-1">Deposit Otomatis</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Dukungan QRIS dan berbagai metode pembayaran yang langsung masuk otomatis.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="w-full py-6 text-center text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-600 border-t border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-900">
    &copy; 2026 KilatOTP. All rights reserved.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>